2383..2457 Comment "/// Spinning undoes winding at every loop (cubical\'s `decodeEncode` at the"
2458..2532 Comment "/// point): the round trip at a variable, by induction over the words. The"
2533..2611 Comment "/// result type reads the word the fold descends on, so each arm answers it at"
2612..2683 Comment "/// its letter and the recursive call at the rest: `sect[<](q)` relates"
2684..2759 Comment "/// `spin(wind(q))` to `q`, and carried along `loopOn` it relates `loop ∷"
2760..2840 Comment "/// spin(wind(q))`, which `spin(wind(loop ∷ q))` runs to, to `loop ∷ q`. The"
2841..2917 Comment "/// case respects the cancellations: at `loop ∷ back(loop) ∷ q` the arms"
2918..3000 Comment "/// compose to `Path.ap(loopOn, Path.ap(unloopOn, p))`, whose functions compose to"
3001..3073 Comment "/// the identity under the words\' rules, so the chain is `p` itself, the"
3074..3092 Comment "/// answer at `q`."
